        "content" : "U(ω) = −(1 − λ)c3U(1)(ω) − (1 + λ)c4U(2)(ω) + c3U(3)(ω) + c4U(4)(ω). The 2 × 2 linear system U(ω) = 0 for the coefficients c3 and c4 has the determinant 4(sin2 λω − λ2 sin2 ω) = 4(sinλω − λsinω)(sinλω + λsinω). (3.2)"
